<title>THAILAND: Thai finmin not seeking Japanese loans in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Thai finmin not seeking Japanese loans in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Finance Minister Thanong Bidaya said on Thursday he would not seek any Japanese loans to help ease Thailand's liquidity and reserve problems during his visit to Tokyo next week.</p>
<p>Thanong told reporters his scheduled trip to Japan was mainly designed to build up ties with his Japanese counterpart.</p>
<p>He said his first overseas trip to Tokyo as a minister was partly influenced by his background as a former student in Japan.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
